			"notes": "### New options:\n- **Player glowing toggle**. Can be used through config (**Disabled** by default), or via a keybind (**Unset** by default). Why? Glowing is ugly, it rips your frames in half, and it's not even useful most of the time!\n- **Potion Info**: adds a message to chat when a potion is thrown by a player. Can be enabled for ALL potions, only Clucking potions, or disabled. (**Default - only clucking**)\n- **Bright Blight**: Blight Wall is always rendered at full brightness. (**Enabled** by default)\n- **Blight Alert**: an additional warning (title) will be shown on the screen when Blight Wave is casted. (**Disabled** by default)\n\n### Other:\n- Now uses YetAnotherConfigLib instead of ClothConfig. After you update, **your config options will be reset**.\n- Rewrote thrown trident CIT to reduce performance impact and increase reliability. Also increased its ability to work outside of Monumenta.\n- Clean Logs now keeps additional useless warnings out of your logs.\n- Overall code cleanup."
		},
